concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-2-sec-8c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8C Information to be published—restrictions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-8c ;
    values:originalText "Exempt documents  (1) An agency is not required under this Part to publish exempt matter. Publication prohibited or restricted by other legislation  (2) If an enactment restricts or prohibits the publication of particular information, an agency is not required under this Part to publish the information otherwise than as permitted or required by the enactment. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Schedule 2  Publication of information" ;
    skos:definition "Exempt documents  (1) An agency is not required under this Part to publish exempt matter. Publication prohibited or restricted by other legislation  (2) If an enactment restricts or prohibits the publication of particular information, an agency is not required under this Part to publish the information otherwise than as permitted or required by the enactment. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Schedule 2  Publication of information"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9b274c64cc036d24900af1d22d9939b25ddce00c90313c48f2ceb896afba693d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "13"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-2-sec-8c-ss-1 ;
