    values:originalText "(1) A function or power given to an agency under this Part may be performed or exercised, on behalf of the agency, by:  (a) the principal officer of the agency; or  (b) an officer of the agency acting within the scope of his or her authority in accordance with arrangements approved by the principal officer of the agency.  (2) The performance or exercise of a function or power under paragraph (1)(b) is subject to the regulations." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A function or power given to an agency under this Part may be performed or exercised, on behalf of the agency, by:  (a) the principal officer of the agency; or  (b) an officer of the agency acting within the scope of his or her authority in accordance with arrangements approved by the principal officer of the agency.  (2) The performance or exercise of a function or power under paragraph (1)(b) is subject to the regulations."@en ;
