    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-1 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: open access period, in relation to a record, has the meaning given by the following provisions:  (a) for a Cabinet notebook—section 22A;  (b) for a record containing Census information—section 22B;  (c) for any other record—subsection (7) of this section." ;
