concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-3-sec-11a-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11A(4) Access to documents on request"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-11a-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The agency or Minister is not required by this Act to give the person access to the document at a particular time if, at that time, the document is an exempt document. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Schedule 3  Exemptions" ;
