concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-3-sec-22-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22(7) Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-22-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) In this section: working day means a day that is not: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Exemptions  Schedule 3 Main exemption amendments  Part 2  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          23  (a) a Saturday; or  (b) a Sunday; or  (c) a public holiday in the place where the function of publishing the information under this section is to be performed." ;
    skos:definition "(7) In this section: working day means a day that is not: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Exemptions  Schedule 3 Main exemption amendments  Part 2  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          23  (a) a Saturday; or  (b) a Sunday; or  (c) a public holiday in the place where the function of publishing the information under this section is to be performed."@en ;
