doc:sch-3-sec-27-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "27(3) Consultation—business documents" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) In determining, for the purposes of paragraph (1)(b), whether the person or organisation concerned might reasonably wish to make an exemption contention because of business information in a document, the agency or Minister must have regard to the following matters:  (a) the extent to which the information is well known;  (b) whether the person, organisation or undertaking is known to be associated with the matters dealt with in the information;  (c) the availability of the information from publicly accessible sources;  (d) any other matters that the agency or Minister considers relevant. Opportunity to make submissions" ;
    cof:pageNumber "30"^^xsd:integer .

concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-3-sec-27-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "27(4) Consultation—business documents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-27-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The agency or Minister must not decide to give access to the document unless:  (a) the person or organisation concerned is given a reasonable opportunity to make submissions in support of the exemption contention; and  (b) the agency or the Minister has regard to any submissions so made." ;
    skos:definition "(4) The agency or Minister must not decide to give access to the document unless:  (a) the person or organisation concerned is given a reasonable opportunity to make submissions in support of the exemption contention; and  (b) the agency or the Minister has regard to any submissions so made."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "dc3f70b5055e6509f6d6917516e1b69be277257140d7bd6c49f6b6718543d396" ;
    values:partOf concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-3-sec-27 ;
    cof:pageNumber "30"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Agency must consult with person or organisation before granting access to document." ;
    dc:description "Submissions in support of exemption contention" ;
