doc:sch-3-sec-31a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "31A Access to exempt and conditionally exempt documents" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The following table summarises how this Act applies to exempt documents and documents that are conditionally exempt:  How this Act applies to exempt and conditionally exempt documents Item If … then … because of … a document is an exempt document under Division 2 (exemptions) or under paragraph (b) or (c) of the definition of exempt document in subsection 4(1) access to the document is not required to be given  subsection 11A(4). a document is a conditionally exempt document under" ;
    cof:pageNumber "35"^^xsd:integer .

concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-3-sec-32 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32 Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-32 ;
    values:originalText "How this Act applies to exempt and conditionally exempt documents Item If … then … because of … access to a document is refused because it contains exempt matter, and the exempt matter can be deleted (a) an edited copy deleting the exempt matter must be prepared (if practicable); and (b) access to the edited copy must be given; section 22. a document is an exempt document because of any provision of this Act access to the document may be given apart from under this Act section 3A (objects— information or documents otherwise accessible)." ;
    skos:definition "How this Act applies to exempt and conditionally exempt documents Item If … then … because of … access to a document is refused because it contains exempt matter, and the exempt matter can be deleted (a) an edited copy deleting the exempt matter must be prepared (if practicable); and (b) access to the edited copy must be given; section 22. a document is an exempt document because of any provision of this Act access to the document may be given apart from under this Act section 3A (objects— information or documents otherwise accessible)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "da211d43940f3c6c0d41326b81eb72741fd11dba21ce94be9f690b93c64cce53" ;
    cof:pageNumber "36"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Access to edited copy of exempt document must be given." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010.pdf, p.36" ;
