doc:sch-3-sec-34-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "34(3) Cabinet documents" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) A document is an exempt document to the extent that it contains information the disclosure of which would reveal a Cabinet deliberation or decision, unless the existence of the deliberation or decision has been officially disclosed. Exceptions" ;
    cof:pageNumber "37"^^xsd:integer .

concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-3-sec-34-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "34(4) Cabinet documents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-34-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) A document is not an exempt document only because it is attached to a document to which subsection (1), (2) or (3) applies. Note: However, the attachment itself may be an exempt document. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Schedule 3  Exemptions" ;
    skos:definition "(4) A document is not an exempt document only because it is attached to a document to which subsection (1), (2) or (3) applies. Note: However, the attachment itself may be an exempt document. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Schedule 3  Exemptions"@en ;
