concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-3-sec-47d a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "47D Public interest conditional exemptions—financial or property"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-47d ;
    values:originalText "interests of the Commonwealth  A document is conditionally exempt if its disclosure under this Act would have a substantial adverse effect on the financial or property interests of the Commonwealth or of an agency. Note: Access must generally be given to a conditionally exempt document unless it would be contrary to the public interest (see section 11A)." ;
    skos:definition "interests of the Commonwealth  A document is conditionally exempt if its disclosure under this Act would have a substantial adverse effect on the financial or property interests of the Commonwealth or of an agency. Note: Access must generally be given to a conditionally exempt document unless it would be contrary to the public interest (see section 11A)."@en ;
