    skos:definition "(1) This section applies if:  (a) on a particular day (the charge notice day) an applicant in relation to a request receives a notice under subsection 29(1) or (6) to the effect that the applicant is liable to pay a charge in respect of the request; and  (b) the notice is received before the end of the period (the processing period) applicable under paragraph 15(5)(b) in relation to the request (or that period as extended). Processing period to be calculated disregarding period when charge unpaid"@en ;
