concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-51da-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "51DA(6) Decision not made on request for amendment or annotation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-51da-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) Subsection (2) (deemed refusal) does not apply, and is taken never to have applied, if the agency or Minister:  (a) makes a decision on the application within the further time allowed; and  (b) complies with any condition imposed under subsection (5)." ;
    skos:definition "(6) Subsection (2) (deemed refusal) does not apply, and is taken never to have applied, if the agency or Minister:  (a) makes a decision on the application within the further time allowed; and  (b) complies with any condition imposed under subsection (5)."@en ;
