concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-51da-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "51DA(7) Decision not made on request for amendment or annotation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-51da-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) However, subsection (2) (deemed refusal) applies as if the initial decision period were extended by the time allowed by the Information Commissioner under subsection (4) if the agency or Minister:  (a) does not make a decision on the request within the further time allowed; or  (b) does not comply with any condition imposed under subsection (5). No further time allowed" ;
    skos:definition "(7) However, subsection (2) (deemed refusal) applies as if the initial decision period were extended by the time allowed by the Information Commissioner under subsection (4) if the agency or Minister:  (a) does not make a decision on the request within the further time allowed; or  (b) does not comply with any condition imposed under subsection (5). No further time allowed"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "435dd922359fd73b29d386b216066851f28187124b5227d8ab833d5b122a4aab" ;
    values:partOf concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-51da ;
    cof:pageNumber "54"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Failure to comply with conditions or make a decision within the allowed time." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
