doc:sch-4-sec-51da-ss-7 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "51DA(7) Decision not made on request for amendment or annotation" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) However, subsection (2) (deemed refusal) applies as if the initial decision period were extended by the time allowed by the Information Commissioner under subsection (4) if the agency or Minister:  (a) does not make a decision on the request within the further time allowed; or  (b) does not comply with any condition imposed under subsection (5). No further time allowed" ;
    cof:pageNumber "54"^^xsd:integer .

concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-51da-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "51DA(8) Decision not made on request for amendment or annotation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-51da-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) If subsection (7) (deemed refusal after allowance of further time) applies, the Information Commissioner does not have the power to allow further time under this section in relation to the decision taken to be made under subsection (2) in its operation as affected by subsection (7)." ;
    skos:definition "(8) If subsection (7) (deemed refusal after allowance of further time) applies, the Information Commissioner does not have the power to allow further time under this section in relation to the decision taken to be made under subsection (2) in its operation as affected by subsection (7)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "58ef8c34d0cacb0912f3f7f7e8ae97b1ad71850d0ae37b3635ca49e78ccb7dea" ;
    values:partOf concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-51da ;
    cof:pageNumber "54"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "No power to allow further time under subsection (7) in relation to the decision taken under subsection (2)" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010.pdf> ;
