concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-54e a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "54E Internal review—decisions to which this Part does not apply"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-54e ;
    values:originalText "This Part does not apply in relation to:  (a) a decision on internal review; or  (b) a decision in relation to the provision of access to a document upon a request that is taken to have been made under section 15AC or 51DA. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Information Commissioner amendments  Schedule 4 Main amendments  Part 1  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          59" ;
    skos:definition "This Part does not apply in relation to:  (a) a decision on internal review; or  (b) a decision in relation to the provision of access to a document upon a request that is taken to have been made under section 15AC or 51DA. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Information Commissioner amendments  Schedule 4 Main amendments  Part 1  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          59"@en ;
