concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-54g a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "54G Key concepts—what is an IC review?"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-54g ;
    values:originalText "An IC review is a review of an IC reviewable decision undertaken by the Information Commissioner under this Part. Note: IC review is short for Information Commissioner review." ;
    skos:definition "An IC review is a review of an IC reviewable decision undertaken by the Information Commissioner under this Part. Note: IC review is short for Information Commissioner review."@en ;
