doc:sch-4-sec-54p-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "54P(3) IC review applications—requirement to notify affected third" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The agency or Minister must, as soon as practicable, give a copy of the notice to the Information Commissioner." ;
    cof:pageNumber "67"^^xsd:integer .

concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-54q a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "54Q IC review applications—circumstances in which not giving"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-54q ;
    values:originalText "notice is appropriate  (1) This section applies in relation to a document to which a consultation requirement applies under section 27 or 27A.  (2) An agency or Minister is not required to notify an affected third party for the document under subsection 54P(2) if:  (a) the agency or the Minister applies to the Information Commissioner for an order that it would not be appropriate to notify the affected third party in the circumstances covered by subsection (3); and  (b) the Information Commissioner makes the order. Note: For affected third party, see section 53C. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Schedule 4  Information Commissioner amendments" ;
    skos:definition "notice is appropriate  (1) This section applies in relation to a document to which a consultation requirement applies under section 27 or 27A.  (2) An agency or Minister is not required to notify an affected third party for the document under subsection 54P(2) if:  (a) the agency or the Minister applies to the Information Commissioner for an order that it would not be appropriate to notify the affected third party in the circumstances covered by subsection (3); and  (b) the Information Commissioner makes the order. Note: For affected third party, see section 53C. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Schedule 4  Information Commissioner amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d3e34f533565775998e433e775ad316dec2619687110f83c56b11ae0adfefbad" ;
    cof:pageNumber "67"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-54q-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-54q-ss-2 ;
