concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-54x-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "54X(3) Decision to review—notice requirement if discretion not to"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-54x-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The notice must:  (a) state the reasons for the Information Commissioner’s decision; and  (b) if the Information Commissioner makes a decision under paragraph 54W(b)—state that an application for review of the relevant IC reviewable decision may be made to the Tribunal under section 57A. Note: See section 57A for the time within which the application for review must be made to the Tribunal." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The notice must:  (a) state the reasons for the Information Commissioner’s decision; and  (b) if the Information Commissioner makes a decision under paragraph 54W(b)—state that an application for review of the relevant IC reviewable decision may be made to the Tribunal under section 57A. Note: See section 57A for the time within which the application for review must be made to the Tribunal."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1c773f4f3b43cbd524966f5609a7584bdd828fd3cfa0b3e6bbbec45e340ed520" ;
    values:partOf concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-54x ;
    cof:pageNumber "71"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Notice must state reasons for Information Commissioner's decision and application details." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
