doc:sch-4-sec-55da a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "55DA Decision-maker must assist Information Commissioner" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "In an IC review, the agency or Minister who made the IC reviewable decision must use the agency’s or the Minister’s best endeavours to assist the Information Commissioner to make his or her decision in relation to the IC review." ;
