concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-55k-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "55K(5) Decision on IC review—decision of Information Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-55k-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) However, a decision on an IC review must not include:  (a) information of the kind referred to in subsection 25(1); or  (b) exempt matter. Note: Subsection 25(1) deals with information about the existence or otherwise of certain documents. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Schedule 4  Information Commissioner amendments" ;
    skos:definition "(5) However, a decision on an IC review must not include:  (a) information of the kind referred to in subsection 25(1); or  (b) exempt matter. Note: Subsection 25(1) deals with information about the existence or otherwise of certain documents. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Schedule 4  Information Commissioner amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f085dc76bd18c44bd53c0f8b5da4ab3f9ad0e26b9296a017f2c0d8db03bacf91" ;
    values:partOf concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-55k ;
    cof:pageNumber "79"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exempt matter cannot be included in a decision on IC review." ;
