    cof:title "55P(1) Decision on IC review—enforcement of decision against agency" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If the principal officer of an agency or a Minister fails to comply with section 55N, an application may be made to the Federal Court of Australia for an order directing the principal officer or Minister to comply." ;
    cof:pageNumber "81"^^xsd:integer .

