concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-78 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "78 Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-78 ;
    values:originalText "Example: The following are examples of obvious errors: (a) an obvious clerical or typographical error in the text of the decision or statement of reasons; (b) an inconsistency between the decision and the statement of reasons.  (2) The Information Commissioner may correct an obvious error:  (a) on an application by a review party; or  (b) on the Information Commissioner’s initiative." ;
    skos:definition "Example: The following are examples of obvious errors: (a) an obvious clerical or typographical error in the text of the decision or statement of reasons; (b) an inconsistency between the decision and the statement of reasons.  (2) The Information Commissioner may correct an obvious error:  (a) on an application by a review party; or  (b) on the Information Commissioner’s initiative."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5c28ac8870c38bfab08868f150d73f59f2b29840187ce6b43efe12b54cf649bf" ;
    cof:pageNumber "82"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Correcting obvious errors in decisions or statements of reasons." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
