doc:sch-4-sec-55t-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "55T(5) Information gathering powers—production of exempt" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) If the document is produced to the Information Commissioner (whether under this section or voluntarily), only the following persons may have access to the document, or to the contents of the document:  (a) the Information Commissioner;  (b) a member of the staff of the Information Commissioner in the course of the performance of his or her duties as a member of that staff. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Information Commissioner amendments  Schedule 4 Main amendments  Part 1  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          81" ;
