doc:sch-4-sec-55z-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "55Z(1) Information gathering powers—protection from liability" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if a person does any of the following in good faith for the purposes of an IC review:  (a) gives information;  (b) produces a document;  (c) answers a question." ;
    cof:pageNumber "87"^^xsd:integer .

concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-55z-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "55Z(2) Information gathering powers—protection from liability"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-55z-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If this section applies, then:  (a) civil proceedings do not lie against a person because the person does any of the matters mentioned in paragraphs (1)(a) to (c); and  (b) the person is not liable for a penalty under a provision of any law because the person does any of those matters." ;
    skos:definition "(2) If this section applies, then:  (a) civil proceedings do not lie against a person because the person does any of the matters mentioned in paragraphs (1)(a) to (c); and  (b) the person is not liable for a penalty under a provision of any law because the person does any of those matters."@en ;
