    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-55zb-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Before determining that an agency or Minister must grant access to a copy of the document with deletions, the Information Commissioner must request the Inspector-General to appear personally and give evidence on:  (a) the damage that would, or could reasonably be expected to, be caused to:  (i) the security of the Commonwealth; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Information Commissioner amendments  Schedule 4 Main amendments  Part 1  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          85  (ii) the defence of the Commonwealth; or  (iii) the international relations of the Commonwealth;  if the proposed deletions were not made; or  (b) whether giving access to the document without the proposed deletions would divulge any information or matter communicated in confidence by, or on behalf of, a foreign government, an authority of a foreign government or an international organisation to the Government of the Commonwealth, to an authority of the Commonwealth or to a person receiving the communication on behalf of the Commonwealth or of an authority of the Commonwealth." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Before determining that an agency or Minister must grant access to a copy of the document with deletions, the Information Commissioner must request the Inspector-General to appear personally and give evidence on:  (a) the damage that would, or could reasonably be expected to, be caused to:  (i) the security of the Commonwealth; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Information Commissioner amendments  Schedule 4 Main amendments  Part 1  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          85  (ii) the defence of the Commonwealth; or  (iii) the international relations of the Commonwealth;  if the proposed deletions were not made; or  (b) whether giving access to the document without the proposed deletions would divulge any information or matter communicated in confidence by, or on behalf of, a foreign government, an authority of a foreign government or an international organisation to the Government of the Commonwealth, to an authority of the Commonwealth or to a person receiving the communication on behalf of the Commonwealth or of an authority of the Commonwealth."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4c4db75eeaae4a40fbda0f6c36c1adb20651dfc151de31e1d657f8d10b3e4870" ;
    values:partOf concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-55zb ;
    cof:pageNumber "88"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Request for personal appearance and evidence on potential damage to Commonwealth security, defence, or international relations if proposed deletions are not made." ;
