concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-55zd a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "55ZD Evidence by Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security—"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-55zd ;
    values:originalText "procedural matters  (1) This section applies for the purposes of enabling the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security to comply with a request under section 55ZB.  (2) The Information Commissioner must allow the Inspector-General to take possession of, and make copies of or take extracts from, any document given to the Information Commissioner for the purposes of the proceeding. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Schedule 4  Information Commissioner amendments" ;
    skos:definition "procedural matters  (1) This section applies for the purposes of enabling the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security to comply with a request under section 55ZB.  (2) The Information Commissioner must allow the Inspector-General to take possession of, and make copies of or take extracts from, any document given to the Information Commissioner for the purposes of the proceeding. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Schedule 4  Information Commissioner amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b15750eb9374f4d609a2128c5fe4a238df7e5e285591968c583ea9089262cdc5" ;
    cof:pageNumber "89"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-55zd-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-55zd-ss-2 ;
