concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-55zd-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "55ZD(2) Evidence by Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security—"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-55zd-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Information Commissioner must allow the Inspector-General to take possession of, and make copies of or take extracts from, any document given to the Information Commissioner for the purposes of the proceeding. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Schedule 4  Information Commissioner amendments" ;
