doc:sch-4-sec-56-2-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "56(5) Appeals—appeals to Federal Court of Australia on questions of" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) The Federal Court of Australia:  (a) must hear and determine the appeal; and  (b) may make any order or orders that it thinks appropriate by reason of its decision." ;
