    values:originalText "(1B) (deadlines for lodging documents) the agency or Minister who made the IC reviewable decision. the person who made the decision to which the relevant proceeding relates subsection 41(4) (stay of decisions being reviewed) each of the review parties. the person who made the decision subsection 41(5) (stay of decisions being reviewed) each of the review parties. the person who made the decision subsection 42A(2) (dismissal for failure to appear) the agency or Minister who made the IC reviewable decision. the person who made a decision section 67A (giving of notices) the person who made the decision or an agency." ;
