concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-70-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "70 Information Commissioner investigations—making complaints"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-70-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person (the complainant) may complain to the Information Commissioner about an action taken by an agency in the performance of functions, or the exercise of powers, under this Act.  (2) A complaint must:  (a) be in writing; and  (b) identify the agency (also the respondent agency) in respect of which the complaint is made.  (3) The Office of the Australian Information Commissioner must provide appropriate assistance to a person who:  (a) wishes to make a complaint; and  (b) requires assistance to formulate the complaint. Subdivision C—Decision to investigate" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person (the complainant) may complain to the Information Commissioner about an action taken by an agency in the performance of functions, or the exercise of powers, under this Act.  (2) A complaint must:  (a) be in writing; and  (b) identify the agency (also the respondent agency) in respect of which the complaint is made.  (3) The Office of the Australian Information Commissioner must provide appropriate assistance to a person who:  (a) wishes to make a complaint; and  (b) requires assistance to formulate the complaint. Subdivision C—Decision to investigate"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c29869358f8b3b9533050ff065131fe3c6030c2c94b91f3466d0e02bfdc64221" ;
    cof:pageNumber "102"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-70-2-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-70-2-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-70-2-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010.pdf, p.102" .
