    skos:definition "(2) The Information Commissioner:  (a) must consult the Ombudsman about the complaint with a view to avoiding inquiries being conducted into that matter by both the Information Commissioner and the Ombudsman; and  (b) may decide not to investigate the action, or not to continue to investigate the action."@en ;
