doc:sch-4-sec-74-2-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "74(2) Information Commissioner investigations—transfer to" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Information Commissioner:  (a) must consult the Ombudsman about the complaint with a view to avoiding inquiries being conducted into that matter by both the Information Commissioner and the Ombudsman; and  (b) may decide not to investigate the action, or not to continue to investigate the action." ;
    cof:pageNumber "104"^^xsd:integer .

concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-74-2-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "74(3) Information Commissioner investigations—transfer to"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-74-2-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the Information Commissioner decides not to investigate, or not to continue to investigate, the action under paragraph (2)(b), the Information Commissioner must:  (a) transfer the complaint to the Ombudsman; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Information Commissioner amendments  Schedule 4 Main amendments  Part 1  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          101  (b) give the Ombudsman any information or documents that relate to the complaint in the possession, or under the control, of the Information Commissioner; and  (c) notify the complainant in writing that the complaint has been transferred." ;
    skos:definition "(3) If the Information Commissioner decides not to investigate, or not to continue to investigate, the action under paragraph (2)(b), the Information Commissioner must:  (a) transfer the complaint to the Ombudsman; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Information Commissioner amendments  Schedule 4 Main amendments  Part 1  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          101  (b) give the Ombudsman any information or documents that relate to the complaint in the possession, or under the control, of the Information Commissioner; and  (c) notify the complainant in writing that the complaint has been transferred."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5c95afbdbab6d6caa2d2fc378914f21468534111e25bfd30b1d31d8a85c7c675" ;
    values:partOf concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-74-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "104"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Transfer complaint to Ombudsman and provide information." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
