concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-74-2-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "74(5) Information Commissioner investigations—transfer to"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-74-2-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A complaint transferred under subsection (3) is taken to be a complaint made to the Ombudsman under the Ombudsman Act 1976. Note: The Information Commissioner may make a decision under this section to investigate only part of a complaint (see section 71)." ;
    skos:definition "(5) A complaint transferred under subsection (3) is taken to be a complaint made to the Ombudsman under the Ombudsman Act 1976. Note: The Information Commissioner may make a decision under this section to investigate only part of a complaint (see section 71)."@en ;
