doc:sch-4-sec-79-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "79(4) Information Commissioner investigations—obliging production" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) The notice must:  (a) be in writing; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Information Commissioner amendments  Schedule 4 Main amendments  Part 1  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          105  (b) specify the place at which the person must comply with the notice; and  (c) state that the person must comply with the notice:  (i) within a specified period that is not less than 14 days after the day on which the person is given the notice; or  (ii) at a specified time that is not less than 14 days after the time at which the person is given the notice. Offence for failure to comply" ;
