doc:sch-4-sec-108-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "108(2) Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) If this section applies, then:  (a) civil proceedings do not lie against a person because the person does any of the matters mentioned in paragraphs (1)(a) to (c); and  (b) the person is not liable for a penalty under a provision of any law because the person does any of those matters." ;
    cof:pageNumber "112"^^xsd:integer .

