concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-89g a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "89G Complaints to Ombudsman—report must not contain certain"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-89g ;
    values:originalText "information  A report under subsection 12(3) or section 15 or 17 of the Ombudsman Act 1976 in relation to an action taken under this Act must not include:  (a) exempt matter; or  (b) information of the kind referred to in subsection 25(1). Note: Subsection 25(1) deals with information about the existence or otherwise of certain documents." ;
    skos:definition "information  A report under subsection 12(3) or section 15 or 17 of the Ombudsman Act 1976 in relation to an action taken under this Act must not include:  (a) exempt matter; or  (b) information of the kind referred to in subsection 25(1). Note: Subsection 25(1) deals with information about the existence or otherwise of certain documents."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "acfaed2622da9c2840f46cad5d0b2068e62e299ab6a104295950e92cf81e50bd" ;
    cof:pageNumber "117"^^xsd:integer ;
