doc:sch-4-sec-89h-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "89H(2) Complaints to Ombudsman—certain rights not affected by" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The certificate does not affect the Ombudsman’s right to:  (a) seek from any person the reasons for a decision made under this Act not to give access to an exempt document; or  (b) require any person to give any information or to answer any questions concerning the decision. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Schedule 4  Information Commissioner amendments" ;
    cof:pageNumber "117"^^xsd:integer .

