doc:sch-4-sec-89k-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "89K(2) Vexatious applicants—declaration" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Information Commissioner may make a declaration:  (a) on the application of an agency or Minister; or  (b) on the Information Commissioner’s initiative. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Information Commissioner amendments  Schedule 4 Main amendments  Part 1  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          115" ;
    cof:pageNumber "118"^^xsd:integer .

