doc:sch-4-sec-89l-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "89L(3) Vexatious applicants—grounds for declaration" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Information Commissioner must not make a declaration in relation to a person without giving the person an opportunity to make written or oral submissions." ;
    cof:pageNumber "119"^^xsd:integer .

concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-89l-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "89L(4) Vexatious applicants—grounds for declaration"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-89l-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) In this section: abuse of the process for an access action includes, but is not limited to, the following:  (a) harassing or intimidating an individual or an employee of an agency;  (b) unreasonably interfering with the operations of an agency; ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Schedule 4  Information Commissioner amendments" ;
