concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-93b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "93B Review of operation of Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-93b ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister must cause a review of the operation of this Act to be undertaken.  (2) The review must:  (a) start 2 years after the commencement of this section; and  (b) be completed within 6 months. Note: This section commences immediately after the commencement of section 3 of the Australian Information Commissioner Act 2010.  (3) The Minister must cause a written report about the review to be prepared.  (4) The Minister must cause a copy of the report to be laid before each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that House after the Minister receives the report. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Information Commissioner amendments  Schedule 4 Other amendments  Part 2  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          121" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister must cause a review of the operation of this Act to be undertaken.  (2) The review must:  (a) start 2 years after the commencement of this section; and  (b) be completed within 6 months. Note: This section commences immediately after the commencement of section 3 of the Australian Information Commissioner Act 2010.  (3) The Minister must cause a written report about the review to be prepared.  (4) The Minister must cause a copy of the report to be laid before each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that House after the Minister receives the report. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Information Commissioner amendments  Schedule 4 Other amendments  Part 2  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          121"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "996096a565f3cc956a3f97652f119354e85e12767992619173b58c0409b7c771" ;
    cof:pageNumber "124"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-93b-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-93b-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-93b-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-93b-ss-4 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010.pdf, p.124" .
doc:sch-4-sec-93b a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "93B Review of operation of Act" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister must cause a review of the operation of this Act to be undertaken.  (2) The review must:  (a) start 2 years after the commencement of this section; and  (b) be completed within 6 months. Note: This section commences immediately after the commencement of section 3 of the Australian Information Commissioner Act 2010.  (3) The Minister must cause a written report about the review to be prepared.  (4) The Minister must cause a copy of the report to be laid before each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that House after the Minister receives the report. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Information Commissioner amendments  Schedule 4 Other amendments  Part 2  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          121" ;
    cof:pageNumber "124"^^xsd:integer .

