concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-66-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "66 Application—Part 2"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-66-2 ;
    values:originalText "The amendments made by Part 2 apply in relation to a complaint made to the Ombudsman under the Ombudsman Act 1976 at or after the commencement of that Part (whether or not the action to which the complaint relates was taken before, at or after that commencement)." ;
