concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-67 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "67 Savings—complaints on foot continue under old law"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-67 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This item applies if:  (a) before the commencement of Part 2, a complaint is made to the Ombudsman under the Ombudsman Act 1976; and  (b) at the commencement of that Part, the Ombudsman has not informed the complainant of the result of the complaint under section 12 of that Act. (2) Despite the amendments made to the Ombudsman Act 1976 by Part 2, the Ombudsman must continue to deal with the complaint under the Ombudsman Act 1976 as if those amendments had not been made. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Amendments consequential on the establishment of the Office of the Australian Information Commissioner  Schedule 5  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          125" ;
    skos:definition "(1) This item applies if:  (a) before the commencement of Part 2, a complaint is made to the Ombudsman under the Ombudsman Act 1976; and  (b) at the commencement of that Part, the Ombudsman has not informed the complainant of the result of the complaint under section 12 of that Act. (2) Despite the amendments made to the Ombudsman Act 1976 by Part 2, the Ombudsman must continue to deal with the complaint under the Ombudsman Act 1976 as if those amendments had not been made. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Amendments consequential on the establishment of the Office of the Australian Information Commissioner  Schedule 5  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          125"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "23c3f080cdcfe9396ac6631524c387d9f7d714064c534614a00c06852a2db4c1" ;
    cof:pageNumber "128"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Continue dealing with complaint under old law if certain conditions met" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010.pdf, p.128" ;
    cml:asserts concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-4-sec-67-norm .
