doc:sch-5-sec-12-2-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "12(3) Guidelines relating to privacy" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The function conferred by subsection (2) is a privacy function for the purposes of the Australian Information Commissioner Act 2010. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Amendments consequential on the establishment of the Office of the Australian Information Commissioner  Schedule 5  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          129" ;
