    values:originalText "Repeal the subsections, substitute: When guidelines take effect  (8) Despite section 12 of the Legislative Instruments Act 2003, guidelines take effect from:  (a) the first day on which they are no longer liable to be disallowed; or  (b) if the guidelines provide for their commencement after that day—in accordance with that provision." ;
