concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-6-sec-140 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "140 Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-6-sec-140 ;
    values:originalText "(2A) An agency is exempt from the operation of this Act in relation to the following documents:  (a) a document (an intelligence agency document) that has originated with, or has been received from, any of the following:  (i) the Australian Secret Intelligence Service;  (ii) the Australian Security Intelligence Organisation;  (iii) the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security;  (iv) the Office of National Assessments;  (v) the Defence Imagery and Geospatial Organisation;  (vi) the Defence Intelligence Organisation;  (vii) the Defence Signals Directorate;  (b) a document that contains a summary of, or an extract or information from, an intelligence agency document, to the extent that it contains such a summary, extract or information." ;
    skos:definition "(2A) An agency is exempt from the operation of this Act in relation to the following documents:  (a) a document (an intelligence agency document) that has originated with, or has been received from, any of the following:  (i) the Australian Secret Intelligence Service;  (ii) the Australian Security Intelligence Organisation;  (iii) the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security;  (iv) the Office of National Assessments;  (v) the Defence Imagery and Geospatial Organisation;  (vi) the Defence Intelligence Organisation;  (vii) the Defence Signals Directorate;  (b) a document that contains a summary of, or an extract or information from, an intelligence agency document, to the extent that it contains such a summary, extract or information."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3db3ae0fb657f2edb6bc9974f4d6f0206273ac73c87cd9615150bb981c9beb0a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "144"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exempts certain documents from the operation of the Freedom of Information Act." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010.pdf, p.144" ;
    cml:asserts concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-6-sec-140-norm .
