doc:sch-6-sec-140 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "140 Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(2A) An agency is exempt from the operation of this Act in relation to the following documents:  (a) a document (an intelligence agency document) that has originated with, or has been received from, any of the following:  (i) the Australian Secret Intelligence Service;  (ii) the Australian Security Intelligence Organisation;  (iii) the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security;  (iv) the Office of National Assessments;  (v) the Defence Imagery and Geospatial Organisation;  (vi) the Defence Intelligence Organisation;  (vii) the Defence Signals Directorate;  (b) a document that contains a summary of, or an extract or information from, an intelligence agency document, to the extent that it contains such a summary, extract or information." ;
    cof:pageNumber "144"^^xsd:integer .

concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-6-sec-21 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21 Subsection 7(2B)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-6-sec-21 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (2B) A Minister is exempt from the operation of this Act in relation to the following documents:  (a) an intelligence agency document;  (b) a document that contains a summary of, or an extract or information from, an intelligence agency document, to the extent that it contains such a summary, extract or information.  (2C) An agency is exempt from the operation of this Act in relation to the following documents:  (a) a document (a defence intelligence document) that has originated with, or has been received from, the Department of Defence and that is in respect of:  (i) the collection, reporting or analysis of operational intelligence; or  (ii) special access programs, under which a foreign government provides restricted access to technologies;  (b) a document that contains a summary of, or an extract or information from, a defence intelligence document, to the ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Other amendments  Schedule 6 Amendments to the Freedom of Information Act 1982  Part 1  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          141 extent that it contains such a summary, extract or information.  (2D) A Minister is exempt from the operation of this Act in relation to the following documents:  (a) a defence intelligence document;  (b) a document that contains a summary of, or an extract or information from, a defence intelligence document, to the extent that it contains such a summary, extract or information." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (2B) A Minister is exempt from the operation of this Act in relation to the following documents:  (a) an intelligence agency document;  (b) a document that contains a summary of, or an extract or information from, an intelligence agency document, to the extent that it contains such a summary, extract or information.  (2C) An agency is exempt from the operation of this Act in relation to the following documents:  (a) a document (a defence intelligence document) that has originated with, or has been received from, the Department of Defence and that is in respect of:  (i) the collection, reporting or analysis of operational intelligence; or  (ii) special access programs, under which a foreign government provides restricted access to technologies;  (b) a document that contains a summary of, or an extract or information from, a defence intelligence document, to the ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Other amendments  Schedule 6 Amendments to the Freedom of Information Act 1982  Part 1  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          141 extent that it contains such a summary, extract or information.  (2D) A Minister is exempt from the operation of this Act in relation to the following documents:  (a) a defence intelligence document;  (b) a document that contains a summary of, or an extract or information from, a defence intelligence document, to the extent that it contains such a summary, extract or information."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fc61fc4a50e655d12b70c909f99174b3a8932dca19bfcf9d8128e3cad72db45b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "144"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-6-sec-21-ss-2b ;
    cml:hasPart concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-6-sec-21-ss-2c ;
    cml:hasPart concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-6-sec-21-ss-2d ;
