doc:sch-6-sec-15ac-ss-7 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "15AC(7) Decision not made on request within time—deemed refusal" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) Subsection (3) (deemed refusal) does not apply, and is taken never to have applied, if the agency or Minister:  (a) makes a decision on the request within the further time allowed; and  (b) complies with any condition imposed under subsection (6)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "148"^^xsd:integer .

concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-6-sec-15ac-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15AC(8) Decision not made on request within time—deemed refusal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-6-sec-15ac-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) However, subsection (3) (deemed refusal) applies as if the initial decision period were extended by the time allowed by the Information Commissioner under subsection (5) if the agency or Minister:  (a) does not make a decision on the request within the further time allowed; or  (b) does not comply with any condition imposed under subsection (6). No further time allowed" ;
    skos:definition "(8) However, subsection (3) (deemed refusal) applies as if the initial decision period were extended by the time allowed by the Information Commissioner under subsection (5) if the agency or Minister:  (a) does not make a decision on the request within the further time allowed; or  (b) does not comply with any condition imposed under subsection (6). No further time allowed"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6e282ba709752a08f94ceaa6de4be67e8ec8607e2bcc53352e923aec60964914" ;
    values:partOf concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-6-sec-15ac ;
    cof:pageNumber "148"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Agency/Minister must comply with conditions or face further time not allowed" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010.pdf, p.148" ;
    cml:asserts concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-6-sec-15ac-ss-8-norm .
