concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-6-sec-146-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "146(3) Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-6-sec-146-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) In deciding whether a practical refusal reason exists, an agency or Minister must not have regard to:  (a) any reasons that the applicant gives for requesting access; or  (b) the agency’s or Minister’s belief as to what the applicant’s reasons are for requesting access; or  (c) any maximum amount, specified in the regulations, payable as a charge for processing a request of that kind." ;
    skos:definition "(3) In deciding whether a practical refusal reason exists, an agency or Minister must not have regard to:  (a) any reasons that the applicant gives for requesting access; or  (b) the agency’s or Minister’s belief as to what the applicant’s reasons are for requesting access; or  (c) any maximum amount, specified in the regulations, payable as a charge for processing a request of that kind."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "14a6b0f5a65f6cf0c28a93231463fdb89df8dcf26986b1d516014f0789295067" ;
    values:partOf concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-6-sec-146 ;
    cof:pageNumber "150"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must not consider certain factors when deciding on a practical refusal reason." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010.pdf, p.150" ;
    cml:asserts concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-6-sec-146-ss-3-norm .
