concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-6-sec-148-ss-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "148(9) Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-6-sec-148-ss-9 ;
    values:originalText "(9) To avoid doubt, this section only obliges the agency or Minister to undertake a request consultation process once for any particular request. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Other amendments  Schedule 6 Amendments to the Freedom of Information Act 1982  Part 1  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          149" ;
