concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-6-sec-24a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "24A Requests may be refused if documents cannot be found, do not"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-6-sec-24a ;
    values:originalText "exist or have not been received Document lost or non-existent  (1) An agency or Minister may refuse a request for access to a document if:  (a) all reasonable steps have been taken to find the document; and  (b) the agency or Minister is satisfied that the document:  (i) is in the agency’s or Minister’s possession but cannot be found; or  (ii) does not exist. Document not received as required by contract  (2) An agency may refuse a request for access to a document if:  (a) in order to comply with section 6C, the agency has taken contractual measures to ensure that it receives the document; and  (b) the agency has not received the document; and  (c) the agency has taken all reasonable steps to receive the document in accordance with those contractual measures." ;
    skos:definition "exist or have not been received Document lost or non-existent  (1) An agency or Minister may refuse a request for access to a document if:  (a) all reasonable steps have been taken to find the document; and  (b) the agency or Minister is satisfied that the document:  (i) is in the agency’s or Minister’s possession but cannot be found; or  (ii) does not exist. Document not received as required by contract  (2) An agency may refuse a request for access to a document if:  (a) in order to comply with section 6C, the agency has taken contractual measures to ensure that it receives the document; and  (b) the agency has not received the document; and  (c) the agency has taken all reasonable steps to receive the document in accordance with those contractual measures."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6109d5d48d5056a074b455723588bde86624a8be6f3014a0f4de8853077f8328" ;
    cof:pageNumber "153"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-6-sec-24a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-6-sec-24a-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010.pdf, p.153" .
