orkplace Relations Act 1996 as in force immediately before the commencement of Schedule 1 to the Fair Work (Transitional Provisions and Consequential Amendments) Act 2009.  Note: ITEA is short for individual transitional employment agreement. pre-reform AWA has the meaning given by clause 1 of Schedule 7 to the Workplace Relations Act 1996 as in force immediately before the commencement of Schedule 1 to the Fair Work (Transitional Provisions and Consequential Amendments) Act 2009. pre-reform certified agreement has the meaning given by clause 1 of Schedule 7 to the Workplace Relations Act 1996 as in force immediately before the commencement of Schedule 1 to the Fair Work (Transitional Provisions and Consequential Amendments) Act 2009. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Schedule 7  Privacy Commissioner transition" ;
