concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-7-sec-4-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 Consultants"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-4-3 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person engaged as a consultant under subsection 26A(3) of the old law immediately before the commencement day is taken, on and after the commencement day, to have been engaged by the Information Commissioner as a consultant under section 24 of the new law. (2) The person is taken to have been engaged on the same terms and conditions as applied to the person immediately before the commencement day. (3) This item does not prevent those terms and conditions being varied after the commencement day. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Privacy Commissioner transition  Schedule 7 Things done by, or in relation to, the Privacy Commissioner  Part 3  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          159" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person engaged as a consultant under subsection 26A(3) of the old law immediately before the commencement day is taken, on and after the commencement day, to have been engaged by the Information Commissioner as a consultant under section 24 of the new law. (2) The person is taken to have been engaged on the same terms and conditions as applied to the person immediately before the commencement day. (3) This item does not prevent those terms and conditions being varied after the commencement day. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Privacy Commissioner transition  Schedule 7 Things done by, or in relation to, the Privacy Commissioner  Part 3  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          159"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "59370d3959a472cb942875bb4df126be9132b9da4c264146c2dcb849b4a12ce9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "162"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Consultant engagement transferred to Information Commissioner" ;
