concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-7-sec-14 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "14 Conference convened, but not held"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-14 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This item applies if:  (a) the Privacy Commissioner convened a conference in accordance with section 47 of the Privacy Act 1988; and  (b) the conference was not held before the commencement day. (2) The Information Commissioner may hold the conference in accordance with section 47 of the Privacy Act 1988 on or after the commencement day." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This item applies if:  (a) the Privacy Commissioner convened a conference in accordance with section 47 of the Privacy Act 1988; and  (b) the conference was not held before the commencement day. (2) The Information Commissioner may hold the conference in accordance with section 47 of the Privacy Act 1988 on or after the commencement day."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e361031eef89327d4b750ed90db4995e0dd38a3932598a65177dbf13e5cf3d10" ;
