concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-7-sec-17 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "17 Reporting requirements"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-17 ;
    values:originalText "Reports for periods ending after the commencement day (1) Subitem (2) applies if:  (a) immediately before the commencement day, a law required the Privacy Commissioner to provide a report in relation to a period; and  (b) the period ends on or after the commencement day. (2) The Information Commissioner must provide the report, as required, in relation to so much of the period as occurs before the commencement day. Reports for periods ending before the commencement day (3) Subitem (4) applies if:  (a) a law required the Privacy Commissioner to provide a report in relation to a period that ended before the commencement day; and  (b) the report was not provided before the commencement day. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Privacy Commissioner transition  Schedule 7 Written instruments and reporting requirements  Part 5  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          165 (4) The Information Commissioner must provide the report as required. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Schedule 7  Privacy Commissioner transition" ;
    skos:definition "Reports for periods ending after the commencement day (1) Subitem (2) applies if:  (a) immediately before the commencement day, a law required the Privacy Commissioner to provide a report in relation to a period; and  (b) the period ends on or after the commencement day. (2) The Information Commissioner must provide the report, as required, in relation to so much of the period as occurs before the commencement day. Reports for periods ending before the commencement day (3) Subitem (4) applies if:  (a) a law required the Privacy Commissioner to provide a report in relation to a period that ended before the commencement day; and  (b) the report was not provided before the commencement day. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Privacy Commissioner transition  Schedule 7 Written instruments and reporting requirements  Part 5  Freedom of Information Amendment (Reform) Act 2010          165 (4) The Information Commissioner must provide the report as required. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00866  Schedule 7  Privacy Commissioner transition"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "85abd608578b4a248bfd3026c3719e8883c320df81f779af8bc3b367c7642d33" ;
    cof:pageNumber "168"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Information Commissioner must provide a report in relation to so much of the period as occurs before the commencement day." ;
    dc:description "true" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010.pdf, p.168" ;
    cml:asserts concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-7-sec-17-norm .
